      "content": "It's true that talking doesn't magically erase bills, but the point of those lines is to help you manage the immediate, crushing weight of the panic so you can think clearly enough to make the next small move. Instead of seeing it as an impossible math problem, maybe we can look at it as a series of small, manageable steps, even tiny ones. Could we focus just on the very next thing, like drafting one email or looking up one specific resource, rather than the entire mountain of debt?",
